se connect to the internet to view and add comments.\"\n const val TEAM_MANAGEMENT_OFFLINE_MESSAGE = \"Team management features require internet connection.\"\n const val INVITATIONS_OFFLINE_MESSAGE = \"Project invitations require internet connection.\"\n const val USER_PROFILES_OFFLINE_MESSAGE = \"User profiles are not available offline.\"\n}"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"edit_file","tool_call_id":"toolu_bdrk_017mgkjHEJXnUThQTZmhHgNy","content":"The apply model made the following changes to the file:

